  "_readme": "Default contract specs. tick_value is the money one tick is worth for ONE lot (forex/CFD) or ONE contract (futures), in value_ccy. Override or add any symbol in trader/instruments.json (same shape; your file wins, field by field). verified=false means the spec depends on your broker or changes from time to time: check it, then set verified=true in your override or list the symbol in config limits.acknowledge_specs. Futures margins change daily, so margin_per_contract is empty until you fill it in.",
